# Python Data Structures & Conditional Statements

This assignment covering basic data structures and conditional statements.

## Topics Covered

- Lists
  - List creation
  - Append, insert, remove and pop
  - Extend and sorting
  - Maximum, minimum and sum
  - List indexing and slicing
  - Reverse order

- Dictionaries
  - Dictionary creation
  - Accessing values
  - Adding and updating elements
  - keys(), values() and items()

- Sets
  - Set creation
  - Removing duplicate values
  - Set indexing and assignment
  - Union and intersection

- Conditional Statements
  - if
  - elif
  - else
  - Performance category based on score

## Key Concepts Practiced

- Python List Operations
- Dictionary Operations
- Set Operations
- Indexing and Slicing
- Built-in Functions
- Conditional Logic

